    {
      "subId": "102303",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10230301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10230301": {
            "id": "10230301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow... This is the <color=#00E1FFFF>Golden House</color>?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230302"
            ]
          },
          "10230302": {
            "id": "10230302",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It looked impressive enough from the outside... But who would've guessed that it was even fancier on the inside... and so full of Mora!!!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230303"
            ]
          },
          "10230303": {
            "id": "10230303",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This is where all of Teyvat's Mora is minted, right? In that case, maybe they won't notice if a few Mora go missing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230306"
            ]
          },
          "10230306": {
            "id": "10230306",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh, so it's a trap. Tricky, tricky... Good thing Paimon's got you here!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230307"
            ]
          },
          "10230307": {
            "id": "10230307",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But even if we can't take any, we can still have a closer look, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230308"
            ]
          },
          "10230308": {
            "id": "10230308",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Or better yet, take a nap on top of a mountain of Mora! It's like a dream come true!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "102302",
      "subQuestName": "Examine the Exuvia",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10230201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10230201": {
            "id": "10230201",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "You've already fulfilled your task as guides, so why do you still linger here? Haven't you already seen enough trouble for today?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230202"
            ]
          },
          "10230202": {
            "id": "10230202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Who's there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230203"
            ]
          },
          "10230203": {
            "id": "10230203",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "If you were Fatui, I imagine that you would be entitled to a generous reward from the Tsaritsa herself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230204"
            ]
          },
          "10230204": {
            "id": "10230204",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "But now, you're nothing but dross — and you're in my way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230206",
              "10230209"
            ]
          },
          "10230206": {
            "id": "10230206",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Hmm, where should I start? Well, I've never been one to beat around the bush, you know. But who could have possibly guessed that the God of Geo would mysteriously perish the very moment I arrived in Liyue, and that the Exuvia would subsequently be hidden away?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230207"
            ]
          },
          "10230207": {
            "id": "10230207",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "If it weren't for that lovely little Rite of Parting ceremony you put together, it would have taken me a whole lot longer to get the information I needed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230211"
            ]
          },
          "10230211": {
            "id": "10230211",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Stopping the Mora mints, hiding away the Exuvia... Hahaha, the Qixing are really pulling out all the stops this time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230212"
            ]
          },
          "10230212": {
            "id": "10230212",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So you've been planning to take the Gnosis from inside the Exuvia all along!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230213"
            ]
          },
          "10230213": {
            "id": "10230213",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "As one of the Eleven Fatui Harbingers, it's my duty to see the will of the Tsaritsa fulfilled.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230214"
            ]
          },
          "10230214": {
            "id": "10230214",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "She will get that which she desires."
          },
          "10230209": {
            "id": "10230209",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Hah! Although I'm deeply grateful to you that I was able to effortlessly find this secret location...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230210"
            ]
          },
          "10230210": {
            "id": "10230210",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Don't you think that trying to stop me now would just be wasted effort?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "102304",
      "subQuestName": "Duel Childe",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "102305",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10230501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10230501": {
            "id": "10230501",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "*panting*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230502"
            ]
          },
          "10230502": {
            "id": "10230502",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Look! Childe's back to normal again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230546"
            ]
          },
          "10230546": {
            "id": "10230546",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Ugh, well then... time to cool off.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230503"
            ]
          },
          "10230503": {
            "id": "10230503",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "It seems the burden of the Foul Legacy Transformation was too great for my body. I lacked the opportunity to think this through...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230504"
            ]
          },
          "10230504": {
            "id": "10230504",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "And now that I consider the matter more carefully, you never had any chance of beating me to the Gnosis.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230505"
            ]
          },
          "10230505": {
            "id": "10230505",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "You had no connection to the Gnosis, no matter where it had been taken.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230506"
            ]
          },
          "10230506": {
            "id": "10230506",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's what we've been trying to tell you! We didn't take it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230507"
            ]
          },
          "10230507": {
            "id": "10230507",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Your show of ability today far surpasses that of Signora's initial assessment of you in Mondstadt. Tell me, how could that be?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230510"
            ]
          },
          "10230510": {
            "id": "10230510",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "You already know the answer, don't you? I can see it in your eyes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230511"
            ]
          },
          "10230511": {
            "id": "10230511",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "But if that is a secret you wish to keep, I guess I'll just have to curb my curiosity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230512"
            ]
          },
          "10230512": {
            "id": "10230512",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "This battle has already left me satisfied.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230513"
            ]
          },
          "10230513": {
            "id": "10230513",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Anyone who strives as I do to grow stronger shall be called a friend, even if our friendship can only be shown in battle against one another.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230514"
            ]
          },
          "10230514": {
            "id": "10230514",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Pretty sure that's not the normal way to make friends.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230515"
            ]
          },
          "10230515": {
            "id": "10230515",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Unfortunately, I must bring this amiable conversation to an end. My quest still beckons.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230516"
            ]
          },
          "10230516": {
            "id": "10230516",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Given that the Gnosis wasn't taken by anyone, then we must look once again to the beginning. Perhaps it was never in the Exuvia to begin with.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230517"
            ]
          },
          "10230517": {
            "id": "10230517",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "In fact, it might be that the Exuvia was just a diversion of sorts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10230518"
            ]
          },
          "10230518": {
            "id": "10230518",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What? So you mean that..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "102306",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10230601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10230601": {
            "id": "10230601",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Hahahahaha! Let's see — will the nation that has lost its deity be swallowed up by an ancient malice once more?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}